if you've ever thought about running  your own business but for whatever  reason we're too afraid to take the jump  you owe it to yourself to at least  investigate it at least look into it  because otherwise you could be making  one of the biggest mistakes of your life  and missing out on a huge opportunity hi  I'm Evan Carmichael your friend in all  things entrepreneurship and I want to  tell you a little bit of a story of how  I got started when I was really young I  didn't have any role models to look up  to to say I want to be like you I want  to be an entrepreneur everybody in my  family had traditional corporate jobs  and that's what I wanted to be growing  up I had my own little ventures you know  when you're really young I sold baseball  cards I joined you in achievement we  create our own little you know company  programs and sold products but when I  graduated high school when they asked me  what did you want to be in ten years  where do you see yourself I wrote down  that would be a VP at some bank how  boring is that and it wasn't until  University where I connected with two of  my friends who had a business and they  invited me to join that I really  considered entrepreneurship as a career  path and I wonder what would have  happened if I didn't talk to those two  friends what would have happened to me  what I have joined the banking ranks be  on my career path because once you get  started it's really hard to jump off and  do your own thing afterwards the further  along you are the more difficult it is  to jump and want to do your own thing  you may want to do it but it's a lot  scarier you have more responsibilities  you have more of a track record or  rebuilt up at your company  and I really am grateful that they asked  me to join their business and i  discovered this world of  entrepreneurship because i didn't have a  huge exposure to it before and I'm so  happy that I didn't go join the  corporate ranks I can't imagine what my  life would look like if I did and so for  you if you've ever thought about  entrepreneurship if you're trying to  figure out what you want to do with your  life at least explore it  entrepreneurship isn't for everybody  it's hard it's going to be one of the  hardest things you ever do in your life  you know it's not easy for sure there's  a lot of benefits but there's a lot of  cons to it too but at least educate  yourself read some books watch some  videos go meet entrepreneurs and what  they're up to and see if that's a  lifestyle that you want and if you are  already an entrepreneur take some  responsibility and teach other people  about it expose them to the world of  business because we don't learn enough  about it in our schools and the  university when we're trained to go get  jobs and you can't blame other people  for that you know you have to take your  own personal responsibility take  accountability if you're interested in  learning about it go learn about it if  you are an entrepreneur and you think it  was the best decision you ever made in  your life teach other people about it  let them know what you're up to expose  them to that world you can help make a  difference in their lives as well thank  you for watching this video if you guys  enjoyed it please give it a thumbs up  below I always seen I love seeing them  come in and if you have a comment I'd  love to hear what you have to think I'd  love to hear your story or if you have a  question feel free leaving a comment  section below I always read those and  again
 

